The temperature of the next day got up to around 1,215 degrees out there. It was deadly. This is John Fife. He's a Presbyterian minister from Tucson, which is a couple of hours from where the migrants crossed. They were in the middle of the most desolate and deadly area of the desert. And I think out of the group of 26, 12 of them died the first day out.
那里的第二天温度飙升到了大约1,215度。这太致命了。这是约翰·法伊夫。他是来自图森的长老会牧师，图森距离移民过境的地方有几个小时的车程。他们当时身处沙漠中最荒凉、最致命的区域。我想在26人当中，有12人在出发的第一天就遇难了。

